### Get OAuth2 Token local
POST http://localhost:9080/realms/ground_control/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type = client_credentials &
client_id = internal &
client_secret = AOjTaQuuhuJV6JHb2yl4aNb7tvH3nW6a

> {%
    // Sauvegarde du token dans les variables globales
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.access_token);
%}



### Get
GET http://localhost:8000/projects/summary?skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json